        <h3>
          <a href="{{ '/projects/multi-view-interactive-world-model/' | relative_url }}">Map-Conditioned Multi-View Interactive World Modeling</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="research-context">Peking University · Advised by Prof. Hao Tang</p>
        <p>
          We adapt <em>LingBot-World</em>, a 14B action-conditioned video Diffusion Transformer, to highly dynamic CS:GO scenes with rapid camera
          motion and abrupt visual changes. The system targets synchronized viewpoints, a stable shared world state, complex interaction, and
          long-horizon generation.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Designed a residual Map Memory conditioning adapter with LoRA.</li>
          <li>Built the end-to-end synchronized multi-view data and evaluation pipeline.</li>
          <li>Trained and debugged distributed experiments on a 16× NVIDIA H200 cluster.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="research-actions">
          <a href="{{ '/projects/multi-view-interactive-world-model/' | relative_url }}">project overview</a>
          <a href="{{ '/assets/pdf/CV_XiaoqiQin.pdf' | relative_url }}">CV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
